WEBVTT

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.370
Is this the finishing blow?!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.270
No! He hung in there!

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:53.000
Rai miraculously persists!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.420
Roar, Galeon!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.470
Spiral Lightning!

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.690
You fool!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.390
Novae Rog!!

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:34.330
The Novae Rog hits its mark!
Rai's out of the stadium!

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:38.230
The northern wolf has sunk its
fangs into the oriental lion!

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:41.590
Yuriy wins the first battle!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.910
With entry to the finals on the line,
the second match continues!

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:58.000
Is Kai Hiwatari going to
take his seat at the finals?

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.320
Or is Rei going to
stop him in his tracks?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:05.520
Everything will be riding
on the second battle!

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.720
These two are
finally going to battle.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.360
Who do you think
is going to win?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.180
That is an incredibly
difficult question to answer.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:21.140
Kai has the advantage in
attack power, but Rei is faster.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:26.230
But there isn't a very large difference.
As for their mental and physical condition...

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:29.260
What, so basically
you don't know?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:34.040
If I knew who was going to win,
we wouldn't be having this problem...

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:38.400
Yeah, you can't tell who's
gonna win or lose until ya fight!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.180
You're real impatient
for an old hag!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.300
Too bad!

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.760
O-l-d h-a-g!

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:01.970
What we do know is that it's going to be
an awesome battle, no matter who wins.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.370
You can do it, Kai, Rei!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.680
Rai...

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.180
Blast it...

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.390
Rai lost...

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.510
Darn... that guy is
way too strong.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.850
What's gotten into you all?!

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:25.910
Rei...

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.240
What did we come
all this way for?

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:37.620
What did we
struggle so much for?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:48.540
What did we fight all those intense
battles against strong opponents for?!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.650
This isn't the
end for me. For us.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.630
We're not done yet!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:59.350
We're going to become
the best in the world!

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:02.020
Yeah! Rei's right!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.850
Yeah! We're just
getting warmed up!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:07.710
Show 'em what
Baihuzu can do!

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.140
That's it!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.720
Let's make an armband!

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.480
Why?

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.000
I'm going to fight
alongside Rei!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.000
I like that! Okay,
I'll fight with him too!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.170
Me too!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.840
--Don't pull too hard!
--You're gonna tear it!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.780
--I'll do it.
--Let me in too!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.510
It's kind of a mess now.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.010
But we put feeling into it.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.490
Thank you. All of you.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:45.070
I believe in you, Rei.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:51.000
Compared to our training on
Mt. Kaiten, this is nothing.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.360
You can do anything
you put your mind to.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.600
Give 'em your best, Rei.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.950
I... No, we're going to win!
That's a promise!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.410
--Yeah!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.400
Well done, Yuriy.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:13.730
No. I wanted to
end that battle sooner.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:16.480
But I didn't think
he'd be so persistent.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.430
We might have a
third battle on our hands.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:44.340
It's finally time for
the second battle!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.090
Are you all ready?!

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:55.280
Their stadium will be the from
the rulers of the Australian plains!

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:58.580
The Shamanic Stadium!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.350
Kai Hiwatari.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:08.090
He's a powerful opponent who might be on
the same level as Takao--or even higher!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.730
But I won't lose to him.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.810
I'm going to make it to
the finals with Baihuzu!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:18.660
And I'll fight Takao with the title
of world champion on the line!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:23.330
I will defeat anyone
who stands in my way.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.450
Three! Two! One!

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:41.070
Wow! Look at that
destructive force!

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.250
It's seriously sharp!

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.700
Skill. Power. Timing.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:49.730
You'd need all three to
make scratches like that.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.140
He's good.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:53.060
But so is Rei.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.990
To be able to take
on Kai's attacks.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.720
Now if only he can last.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.900
Here he comes again.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.840
Not done yet!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.840
There it is!
Rei's high speed attack!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.930
He's using the pillars
to toss Kai around!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.680
Keep it up, Rei!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.440
Then I'll just have
to drag you down.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.310
Get back here!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.990
Dranzer Gigus is destroying the
pillars to remove Driger's footing!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.600
Is he going to fall back
down to the ground?

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.580
I've got plenty of
places to land!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.590
Fly, Driger!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:51.320
Whoa! Driger is coming down
by using the scraps of pillar!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:58.110
What a truly incredible display
of power and technique!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:01.350
Wow! This is awesome!
Kai! Rei!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.390
You guys are too cool!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.280
Kai's attack power...
Rei's technique...

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:10.220
They're producing higher numbers
than anything I've seen before.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.440
So who's going to win?

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.940
Their abilities are
completely even.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:17.160
I think they're in it
for the long haul.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.000
I'm not so sure.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.670
Look at them closely.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.290
Come to think of it...

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.540
When did they
start sweating?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:33.760
No way! Are they
already getting tired?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:38.080
They've been battling at full
throttle from the outset.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:43.770
Each attack has the power
to deal the fatal blow.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:48.020
On top of that, neither one of them is
letting the other slip up--even for a second.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.700
The pressure and strain
on their stamina...

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:54.090
Is tens of times higher
than a normal match.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.140
I imagine the battle will be
over in the blink of an eye.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.270
The blink of an eye?

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:02.200
They can't even
afford to blink...

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.290
Kai... Rei...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.260
Not yet! I can't
allow myself to lose!

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.930
He's as good as
I expected. But...!

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:13.860
Both of them
circle the edge!

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:17.420
Are they going to bring
out their special moves?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:21.300
Blazing Gig!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.720
Gatling Claw!!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.100
It's a head-on clash
of special moves!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.290
Who's still up?!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.040
Rei!!

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.180
Rei is down!

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:13.850
He's not moving
at all! Is he okay?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:18.450
Rei...

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.770
He lost...

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.890
No way! It's not true!

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.200
It's over.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.630
Then it's just the finals.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:26.290
Rei!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:27.490
Wait!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.140
Why're you stopping us, Rai?!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.600
Look!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.500
Rei's Driger is still spinning.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.880
This battle is
far from over!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.740
You're right...

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:42.000
It's Driger!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.390
The second we interfere
is the end of the match!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.520
Do you want to
interrupt Rei's battle?

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.210
Rei's battle...

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.020
We have to
believe in Rei!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.730
There's no way
he'd let it end here!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.200
Okay, Rai!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.470
An announcement
to the viewers.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:07.500
Unfortunately, we must deem
Rei unable to continue the battle.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:11.410
We will declare Kai the
victor of the second battle.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.820
This an official decision
from the tournamen--

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.740
--Stop!

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:18.390
What's with you three?!

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.100
--Wait, sir!

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.740
He can still fight!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:26.300
I understand how you feel, but
what if something happens to Rei?!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.210
Nothing's gonna happen!
Rei's gonna win! Win!!

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.680
But this is--

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.460
He can still do it!

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.660
Rei! You've just
gotta wake up!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.940
Driger's waiting for you!

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:48.990
You can do it!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.240
You promised us that
we'd make it to the finals!

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:56.330
That you'd defeat Takao Kinomiya
and become the world champion!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.680
We don't want
it to end here.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.650
We want to keep
fighting together!

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.170
So please stand up!!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.560
Rei!!

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.020
My team...

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.680
He's right! This isn't the
time for me to be laying down!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:18.080
My best friends...
On the ultimate stage...!

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.830
And my ultimate rival
are waiting for me!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.530
I...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.520
I am...

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.290
Never going to lose!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:36.240
He's up!! From the brink of
defeat, Rei rises like a phoenix!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:39.090
This ferocious tiger's
fangs are still sharp!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.360
This match is back on!
It's back on!

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.500
Rei stood back up!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.630
That's the way, Rei!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.960
Watch me, guys.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.470
It's time for me to make
good on your hopes!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.830
Come on!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:57.300
This match is back on track!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:59.820
Their clashes will continue!

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.880
This battle is so awesome!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.090
But will he be okay?

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:08.450
Rei should be almost
out of strength.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.610
Can he stand up to
Kai's intense attacks?

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:14.650
He's come this far,
so none of that matters!

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:17.290
The rest is up
to what's inside.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:24.660
What?!

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.950
Unbelievable!
Look at this high speed!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:36.910
Moving at lightning speed,
he unleashes a storm of attacks!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:41.330
Kai's being put on defense!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:44.480
Was he really in pain
just moments earlier?!

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.940
They're fast... Way too fast!

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.340
They're making my head spin!

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:58.720
Of course! Because Rei's got
all of our hopes with him!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.630
Today, Driger's four times as strong!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.410
Go for it, Rei!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.020
Driger finally got a
good hit on Dranzer!

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.570
A powerful strike
hits the mark!

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:24.730
A blow so strong it broke
the stadium! Is that the end?

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:52.050
Whoa! Kai's still going strong!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.820
I can't believe it!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.840
He's still up after that blow...

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.560
Kai, you really are
something else...

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:06.540
Rei, did you think I came to the world
championships without a surprise or two?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.650
What?!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.580
Let me show you!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.140
This is my new attack!

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:26.920
Here I come, Kai Hiwatari!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.270
A new attack?

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:32.280
When did he...?

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:36.330
Is that what that was?

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.310
Where were you?

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.070
We're leaving for
America tomorrow.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.970
Don't take the world
championships lightly.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:59.200
Wait. I'm not done
talking to you yet.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.930
What the hell
happened to your arm?

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:17.210
It was days later that I
learned that the rock was split.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.600
Was Kai hiding this from
the world all along?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:25.990
A sudden change of pace from
this storm of an intense battle!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.560
The silent staredown continues!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:32.940
This must be the calm
before a bigger storm!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.750
Gatling Claw Maximum!!

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.960
Wow! Driger has vanished!
What's going on here?

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:06.820
No, wait!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.800
Driger has to be
somewhere in here!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.850
Our eyes can't keep
up with that speed!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.860
Blazing Gig...

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.840
Tempest!!!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.410
It's over! In a huge upset,
he finally turns the tables!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.290
Kai Hiwatari wins
the second battle!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:17.800
Neo-Borg earns its
ticket to the finals!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:22.330
Sadly, Baihuzu is
unable to proceed!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.370
Rai...

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:38.720
You were incredible.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.620
You really were.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.730
Rei!!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.820
You're the best, Rei!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.220
Thank you!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.100
Rei! I... I'm...!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.300
All of you...

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.440
Rei.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.920
Thank you...

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.340
Driger!

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:12.820
Kai!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.300
Good luck in the finals.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.030
That was an amazing battle.

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:29.780
Damn... Now I can't wait!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:34.660
We're gonna win! And I'm gonna
get my revenge on Kai Hiwatari!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:36.730
That's the spirit, Rick!

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:38.600
Watch me! Rei! Kai!

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:43.300
I'm gonna show you a battle
that's just as intense as yours was!

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.960
What a guy...
He's completely calm.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.930
Because he won, obviously.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.290
No...

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:11.430
Kai put everything on the line
with his battle against Rei.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:15.010
To the point of using the trump
card he was saving for the finals.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:16.680
Rei...

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:19.710
You've proven how
tenacious you are.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:23.350
I will win...
for my Beyspirit!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:25.880
For my battle with you!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:29.790
Now...
Meet me in the finals...

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.540
Kinomiya...!

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:59.490
Well, it's the final match
of the round robin matches!

00:22:59.490 --> 00:23:02.960
We have to win if we want
to advance to the finals!

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:04.350
It's up to you, Takao!

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:06.180
You have to win, Takao!

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:09.760
Hmph! All of you are
just Takao this, Takao that!

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:12.180
Who do you think
really got you this far?

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:17.170
Just watch me! Time to show you
what the BBA's Daichi Sumeragi can do!

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:21.940
Full Power!
Go, Gaia Dragoon!
